Brand marks in this folder come from Simple Icons, version 16.38.1.
Source: https://github.com/simple-icons/simple-icons (npm package "simple-icons").
Simple Icons is released under CC0 1.0 Universal. The 43 icons here are the ones the mock carries
(mock/icons/brands/), copied unchanged from there; the page bundles them and draws a site's mark from
its path, in the card's icon colour. Nothing is fetched at run time.

The marks are trademarks of their owners. Simple Icons' data lists a license for some icons; icons with
a license other than CC0 (Rust, CC-BY-SA-4.0, and Lobsters, BSD-3-Clause) were left out. None of the
icons here is marked as not to be used.

